<uui-button class="orange" size="xs" id="crf-compat-run" onclick="crfRunCompatibility();return false;">Run compatibility test</uui-button>

_(Pool definitions)_:
: <input type="hidden" name="RUNNER_POOLS" id="crf-pools-value" value="<?=htmlspecialchars(crfp_g($cfg,'RUNNER_POOLS'),ENT_QUOTES)?>">
